    &gt;網路概論與實務第七版-楊豐瑞、楊豐任 著&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.monolithicpower.com/en/learning/resources/analog-vs-digital-signal&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;mps&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
